WEBVTT

1
00:00:04,180 --> 00:00:05,820
Thanks, it's okay

2
00:00:06,060 --> 00:00:07,020
Run quickly, senior

3
00:00:09,150 --> 00:00:14,900
How are you guys cracking it? It's almost there. There are still two to go and one to go. No, no, not all.

4
00:00:14,900 --> 00:00:15,820
All cracked

5
00:00:16,260 --> 00:00:19,540
There's still only one left to go. Sorry, sister.

6
00:00:19,540 --> 00:00:20,700
That guy is here to block us.

7
00:00:21,060 --> 00:00:23,080
Damn you

8
00:00:23,080 --> 00:00:35,570
Why don't we just leave? Why should we leave?

9
00:00:35,570 --> 00:00:37,010
As soon as you want to sell, you can leave.

10
00:00:37,010 --> 00:00:38,330
Why don't you slaughter a batch of them?

11
00:00:38,690 --> 00:00:42,890
It's better to just stand there and don't move.

12
00:00:43,330 --> 00:00:44,650
Otherwise I will close the door
